            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I came looking if somebody else has noticed this. Tried with 0.10.0 and `nvim --clean` does not reproduce issue.\r\n\r\nSeems to be a matter of treesitter capture, as conceal around tags works normally after `:TSDisable highlight`.\r\n\r\n`:set conceallevel=2`\r\n`:TSDisable highlight`\r\n`:help autocmd`\r\n\r\n```\r\nAutomatic commands                                      autocmd autocommand\r\n\r\nFor a basic explanation, see section 40.3 in the user manual.\r\n\r\n                                      Type gO to see the table of contents.\r\n...\r\n```\r\n\r\n`:TSEnable highlight`\r\n`:help autocmd`\r\n\r\n```\r\nAutomatic commands \r\n\r\nFor a basic explanation, see section  in the user manual.\r\n\r\n                                      Type  to see the table of contents.\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n",
