            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "I can reproduce this with v0.13.0-dev-631+ga5d4b4e0fc and `nvim --clean`. I just wanted to create an issue about it. Although not with OP's `autocmd.txt` example, but with e.g. the line that states the default value for `g:netrw_sort_sequence`.\n\nRenders:\n\n```\n                                 default: '[\\/]$,,\\.bak$,\\.o$,\\.h$,\n                                           \\.info$,\\.swp$,\\.obj$'\n```\n\nShould be:\n\n```\n                                 default: '[\\/]$,*,\\.bak$,\\.o$,\\.h$,\n                                           \\.info$,\\.swp$,\\.obj$'\n```\n\nNote how in the first example there is no asterisk in the beginning of the first line.",
